  "Size duckweed-drift-primer passives at 7.9 W of 8.0 W (healing_pct 5, evade_pct 2, linh_luc_regen_inc_pct 3) and unlock close-over-the-stone at layer 1 and chance-meeting at layer 2 so all outer holders (layers 2-4) access both arts.",
  "Author close-over-the-stone as a Wood heal art (c_heal 0.4, buff [1, 8.0]) carrying the reactive was_hit (event.amount > 0, cooldown 6.0) 3-pulse heal (1.5 %/s) so it fires usefully in sect_fight.py without clobbering active ticks.",
  "Author chance-meeting as a Water quick strike (c_art 1.5, cooldown 2.0, buff [1, 8.0]) instead of adding an own.purity comparison word for a Yellow outer primer, keeping both Water and Wood represented across the technique's two arts.",
  "Approximate Every Day of the Year slow/delay immunity across all foe slows/delays while carrying a Water buff stack (status_immune slowed_time + delay_immune) because engine checks do not expose the foe art's element.",
  "Rewrite Somewhere Else by Morning non-spatially (remove 'behind the attacker') and order evaded consume-5 (own.buff.water >= 5) before evaded +1 Water buff so reaching 5 stacks waits for the next evade to trigger the 5 s healing tide.",
  "Coordinate Slack Water and The Tenth Layer order-independently via slack_water_threshold and slack_just_healed pulse-handshake counters (declared on both Effects for standalone parity), arming Slack Water on buff_gained so empowered swelling-tide-palm still heals, and refreshing Water buffs on blocked (event.amount > 0). Mark all 7 items unique: true (sources: [npc]) with R6 exception on the 4 weapons/armour/shield."
